TITLE  1D ion exchange

SOLUTION 0  CaCl2

        units   mol/l

        pH      7.0     charge

        pe      12.5   O2(g)  -0.68

        temp    25.0

        Ca      0.0006

        Cl      0.0012

        Na      1e-9

        K       1e-9

        N(+5)   1e-9

SOLUTION 1  Initial solution for column

        units   mol/l

        pH      7.0     charge

        pe      12.5   O2(g)  -0.68

        temp    25.0

        Na      0.001

        K       0.0002

        N(+5)   0.0012

        Ca      1e-9

        Cl      1e-9



EXCHANGE 1

        equilibrate 1

        X       1.09375



END



SELECTED_OUTPUT

    -file  ionx.out

    -reset      true

USER_PUNCH

-headings Ca Cl Na K CaX2 NaX KX  

10 PUNCH TOT("Ca"), TOT("Cl"), TOT("Na"), TOT("K")

20 ca_x2 = MOL("CaX2")*100/1.875*0.3*2

30 na_x = MOL("NaX")*100/1.875*0.3

40 k_x = MOL("KX")*100/1.875*0.3

50 PUNCH ca_x2 na_x k_x



END

